# ── Generated review artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The full-resolution page captures (225 MB) are working files for showing
# the site to people. They are regenerated with
#   node tools/capture-pages.mjs
# and are delivered separately as a handover folder, not as repository files.
docs/mockups/

# The review set itself (21 MB — 60 screens + 3 contact sheets + the gallery
# page) IS committed: the team shares it by URL, so it needs to live in the
# repository. See docs/review-set/index.html and the gh-pages branch.

# ── Un-optimised image masters ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Working files for the media pipeline. The optimised images in
# public/media/ are what the site ships; the masters are not site assets.
tools/media/_masters/
